          "_name": "afeatures6",
          "_sourceTheme": "calmm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features6 calmm5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"SubTitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"List Count\" name=\"listCount\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showSubtitle || showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/background3.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container-small': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gruppe-von-grafik-designer-digitalen-tablet-waehrend-kaffee.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-text\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Σας προσφέρουμε:</b></h5>\n                <div class=\"content-box\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle || showText\">\n                    <div class=\"content-item\">\n                        <p class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            <b><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-primary\">01.</a>&nbsp;Εξειδικευμένη ομάδα</b></p>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Στο πλάϊ σας βρίσκεται μία ομάδα Ειδικών σε θέματα Online πωλήσεων, διαφήμισης και Συμβουλευτικών υπηρεσιών.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"content-item\" mbr-if=\"listCount > 1\">\n                        <p class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            <b><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-primary\">02.</a>&nbsp;Άμεση επικοινωνία&nbsp;</b></p>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Πέραν από την τηλεφωνική ή την E-Mail επικοινωνία, σας προσφέρουμε επίσης την δυνατότητα απευθείας επικοινωνίας μέσω Chat με ένα απλό κλικ.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"content-item\" mbr-if=\"listCount > 2\">\n                        <p class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            <b><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-primary\">03.</a>&nbsp;Γρήγορη υλοποίηση</b></p>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Αναλαμβάνουμε το σετάρισμα τιμών και συνδεσιμοτήτων συμβουλεύοντάς σας τί θα πρέπει να κάνετε, για να πετύχετε περισσότερες κρατήσεις και υψηλότερους τζίρους.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"content-item\" mbr-if=\"listCount > 3\">\n                        <p class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                            <b><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-primary\">04.</a> Fast working process</b>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Gravida dictum fusce ut placerat orci nulla pellentesque dignissim enim. Dolor sed viverra ipsum nunc aliquet bibendum.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    <a href class=\"btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        GET STARTED\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tBopIGNQdh",
          "_anchor": "afeatures6-d",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-head": {
              "margin-bottom": "70px",
              "@media (max-width: 1399px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "60px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "30px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "margin-top": "18px",
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".cards-row": {
              "margin-top": "5px",
              "row-gap": "30px"
            },
            ".card": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "stretch",
              "border-radius": "0"
            },
            ".card-wrapper": {
              "width": "~\"calc(100% - 14px)\"",
              "padding": "80px 40px 60px 40px",
              "margin": "0 auto",
              "border": "2px solid @cardBorder",
              "box-shadow": "4px 4px 0 @cardBorder",
              "background": "@cardBg",
              "transition": ".3s all",
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "padding": "40px 30px"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "&:hover": {
                  "box-shadow": "none",
                  "transform": "translateY(-5px)"
                }
              }
            },
            ".iconfont-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "60px",
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "25px"
              },
              ".mbr-iconfont": {
                "display": "block",
                "font-size": "100px",
                "color": "@iconColor"
              }
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".card-text": {
              "margin-top": "10px",
              "color": "#131313",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".card-link": {
              "margin-top": "30px",
              "color": "#131313",
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "margin-top": "20px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-top": "15px"
              },
              "a.text-primary": {
                "&:hover": {
                  "color": "#131313 !important"
                }
              }
            },
            ".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "afeatures1",
          "_sourceTheme": "calmm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features1 calmm5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <select title=\"Align\" name=\"contentAlign\">\n            <option value=\"justify-content-start\">Left</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-center\" selected>Center</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-end\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcon\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#FC7942\" condition=\"showIcon\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Link\" name=\"showLink\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Bg\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#FFFFFF\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Border\" name=\"cardBorder\" value=\"#131313\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/background2.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/background2.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container-small': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                    <b>Our incredible services</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                    Suspendisse sed nisi lacus sed viverra tellus.\n                </h5>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row cards-row {{contentAlign}}\" mbr-if=\"showIcon  || showTitle || showText || showLink\">\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-left-right\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>2-way xml συνδέσεις</b></h5>\n                    <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Όλες οι συνδέσεις και οι συγχρονισμοί δεδομένων με τα πόρταλ κρατήσεων γίνονται μέσα σε λίγα δευτερόλεπτα αμφίδρομα (2-way) μέσω xml και με 100% ασφαλείς διαδικασίες και πρωτόκολλα.</p>\n                    <p class=\"card-link mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showLink\" data-app-selector=\".card-link\">\n                        <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"text-primary\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-users\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Εξυπηρέτηση πελατών</b></h5>\n                    <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Για οποιεσδήποτε τεχνικές, λειτουργικές ή συμβουλευτικές ερωτήσεις μπορείτε να επικοινωνήσετε μαζί μας μέσω του LIVE Chat με ένα κλικ μέσω WhatsApp ή Viber.</p>\n                    <p class=\"card-link mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showLink\" data-app-selector=\".card-link\">\n                        <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"text-primary\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-like\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>1η εγκατάσταση (Setup)</b></h5>\n                    <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Η ομάδα μας σετάρει όλα τα στοιχεία του ξενοδοχείου ή του καταλύματός σας σε όλα τα επίπεδα για να μην συμβούν λάθη στις συνδεσιμότητες. Επίσης εισάγουμε τις υπάρχουσες κρατήσεις στο λογισμικό.</p>\n                    <p class=\"card-link mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showLink\" data-app-selector=\".card-link\">\n                        <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"text-primary\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tBon8M64Sx",
          "_anchor": "afeatures1-3",
