ass=\"list-group-item\">Σύνδεση με 4 πόρταλ επιλογής σας (βλ. λίστα)</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Σετάρισμα μηχανής κρατήσεων με BOOK NOW Button με 0% προμήθεια</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">ΔΩΡΕΑΝ σύνδεση myDATA</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">ΔΩΡΕΑΝ ενεργοποίηση PCI για κάρτες</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center pt-4 \" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"mbrext://smart-cart?cmdsm=_cart&amount=13.50&item_name=All%20in%20One%20FLAT%20BMB%20CM%20(MHNIAIA)%20%CE%B1%CE%BD%CE%AC%20unit&currency_code=EUR&dataShop=smartCart\">ONLINE -10%</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 my-3 justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': itemsCount == 3, 'col-lg-6': itemsCount == 2, 'col-lg-3': itemsCount == 4}\" mbr-if=\"itemsCount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-header text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"plan-title mbr-semibold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".plan-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">All in one FLAT για BnB από 3 unit και άνω*</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-price\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"price-figure color1 pb-1 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".color1\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">€10</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"price-term pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".price-term\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">*ανά unit / μήνα</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-list align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush mbr-font