\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-header text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"plan-title mbr-semibold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".plan-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">All in one CM FLEX*</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-price\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"price-figure color2 pb-1 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".color2\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">€2</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"price-term pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".price-term\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">*ανά δωμάτιο / μηνιαία για ξενοδοχείο με 8+ δωμάτια + €2/check-in&nbsp;</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line line2 \"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-list align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Σετάρισμα All in One Channel Manager</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Σύνδεση με 4 πόρταλ επιλογής σας (βλ. λίστα)</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Σετάρισμα μηχανής κρατήσεων με BOOK NOW Button με + €2/check-in</li><li class=\"list-group-item\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.125rem;\">ΔΩΡΕΑΝ ενεργοποίηση PCI για κάρτες</span></li><li class=\"list-group-item\"><br></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center pt-4 \" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"mbrext://smart-cart?cmdsm=_cart&amount=1.80&item_name=All%20in%20One%20Channel%20manager%20%CE%B1%CE%BD%CE%AC%20%CE%B4%CF%89%CE%BC%CE%AC%CF%84%CE%B9%CE%BF%20%CE%BC%CE%B7%CE%BD%CE%B9%CE%B1%CE%AF%CE%B1%20%CF%83%CF%85%CE%BD%CE%B4%CF%81%CE%BF%CE%BC%CE%AE%3A%20%CE%95%CF%80%CE%B9%CE%BB%CE%AD%CE%BE%CF%84%CE%B5%20%CF%84%CE%BF%CE%BD%20%CE%B1%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%B8%CE%BC%CF%8C%20%CE%B4%CF%89%CE%BC%CE%B1%CF%84%CE%AF%CF%89%CE%BD%20%CF%84%CE%BF%CF%85%20%CE%BE%CE%B5%CE%BD%CE%BF%CE%B4%CE%BF%CF%87%CE%B5%CE%AF%CE%BF%CF%85%20%CF%83%CE%B1%CF%82%20(%CF%80%CE%AC%CE%BD%CF%89%20%CE%B1%CF%80%CF%8C%208)&currency_code=EUR&dataShop=smartCart\">ONLINE -10%</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 my-3 justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': itemsCount == 3, 'col-lg-6': itemsCount == 2, 'col-lg-3': itemsCount == 4}\" mbr-if=\"itemsCount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-header text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"plan-title mbr-semibold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".plan-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">ONLINE PORTALS*</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-price\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"price-figure color1 pb-1 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".color1\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">€10</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"price-term pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".price-term\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">*ανά πόρταλ / μήνα για επιπλέον συνδέσεις πέραν των 4 πόρταλ</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-list align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">1. ΔΩΡΕΑΝ Σύνδεση με 4 πόρταλ από την παρακάτω λίστα:</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">Booking, Expedia, AirBnB, agoda, CTrip, HipCamp, Hopper, Hostelworld, hotelbeds, HRS, HyperGuest, MakeMyTrip, Mr &amp; Mrs Smith, Wink, HomeAway / VRBO</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">2. Επιπλέον συνδέσεις με extra χρέωση:</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">Avis, Budget, Europcar, Hertz</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">GDS 400.000 travel agents (amadeus, sabre, travelport, Pegasus)</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">Trivago, Metasearch, Google Hotel Search, Google VR</li><li class=\"list-group-item\">atrapalo, bedandbreakfast, bestfewo, check24, corporate rates club, ebay, eDreams ODIGEOm goibibo, Greenstorm, Hostelsclub, HotelSpecials, interhome, kurz-mal-weg, ostrovok, Schmetterling, TOMAS, TravelRepublic</li><li class=\"list-group-item\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.125rem;\">Προϋπόθεση: Έχετε ήδη συμβόλαιο με το OTA, και τα στοιχεία είναι σεταρισμένα σωστά σε αυτό&nbsp;</span><br></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center pt-4 \" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"mbrext://smart-cart?cmdsm=_cart&amount=9.00&item_name=All%20in%20One%20OTA%3A%20%CE%95%CF%80%CE%B9%CE%BB%CE%AD%CE%BE%CF%84%CE%B5%20%CF%84%CE%BF%CE%BD%20%CE%B1%CF%81%CE%B9%CE%B8%CE%BC%CF%8C%20%CE%B5%CF%80%CE%B9%CF%80%CE%BB%CE%AD%CE%BF%CE%BD%20%CF%80%CF%8C%CF%81%CF%84%CE%B1%CE%BB&currency_code=EUR&dataShop=smartCart\">ONLINE -10%</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 my-3 justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4': itemsCount == 3, 'col-lg-6': itemsCount == 2, 'col-lg-3': itemsCount == 4}\" mbr-if=\"itemsCount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-header text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"plan-title mbr-semibold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".plan-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">IMPORT DATA</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-price\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"price-figure color2 pb-1 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".color2\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">€79</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"price-term pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".price-term\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">πάγιο ποσό</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line line2 \"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"plan-list align-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Εισαγωγή κρατήσεων από άλλο PMS μέσω .csv αρχείου</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Ηλεκτρονική εισαγωγή μελλοντικών κρατήσεων από Booking, Expedia, AirBnB</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn text-center pt-4 \" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"mbrext://smart-cart?cmdsm=_cart&amount=79.00&item_name=IMPORT%20DATA%20All%20in%20One%20LIGHT&currency_code=EUR&dataShop=smartCart\">ONLINE DEAL</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
